WEBVTT

00:00:37.471 --> 00:00:41.208
What is beyond that river?

00:00:41.341 --> 00:00:44.077
The ocean.

00:00:44.811 --> 00:00:47.147
What is beyond the ocean?

00:00:47.214 --> 00:00:50.083
Foreign lands.

00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:55.088
I would like to see...

00:00:55.155 --> 00:00:57.691
how they live their lives there.

00:03:08.455 --> 00:03:09.856
From the ocean?

00:03:10.957 --> 00:03:13.727
Did we deal with the visitors yet?

00:03:13.794 --> 00:03:16.830
All units are responding to signals.

00:03:16.897 --> 00:03:20.200
It seems that a few of them
have fled outside our site.

00:03:20.267 --> 00:03:24.204
Major, they've appeared in areas
around the world as well.

00:03:24.638 --> 00:03:27.908
At least three objects
have been confirmed.

00:03:28.275 --> 00:03:30.811
Any word from the UN Headquarters?

00:03:30.877 --> 00:03:32.412
Nothing yet.

00:03:32.479 --> 00:03:34.748
It seems information is getting scrambled.

00:03:34.915 --> 00:03:38.585
And it appears that each country
has entered combat.

00:03:38.985 --> 00:03:41.722
Doomsday, huh?

00:04:07.347 --> 00:04:09.249
Yukina, are you okay?

00:04:09.683 --> 00:04:11.485
Why were you there?

00:04:11.551 --> 00:04:13.553
You should've just gone home!

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:14.921
But...

00:04:18.325 --> 00:04:21.394
Was he kept on life support?

00:04:21.461 --> 00:04:23.430
Or cryogenic sleep?

00:04:24.865 --> 00:04:26.032
Did he say anything?

00:04:26.299 --> 00:04:27.934
Just his name.

00:04:28.001 --> 00:04:30.403
He spoke in Japanese?!

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:32.839
What is his name?

00:04:32.906 --> 00:04:36.476
Kennosuke Tokisada Oma?

00:04:37.377 --> 00:04:39.746
Never heard of him.

00:04:41.314 --> 00:04:43.517
I'll try talking to him.

00:04:44.951 --> 00:04:46.753
This is Director Shirahane.

00:04:46.820 --> 00:04:51.825
Shouldn't the man from the cube
be waking up soon?

00:04:53.426 --> 00:04:55.328
That's true, but...

00:04:55.395 --> 00:04:57.631
Hold on.

00:04:57.798 --> 00:04:59.533
Hiromi, what's going on?

00:04:59.599 --> 00:05:01.334
Paula, come with me.

00:05:01.401 --> 00:05:04.371
Jiro, get back to your post.

00:05:04.538 --> 00:05:05.405
Director?

00:05:05.472 --> 00:05:07.007
Yukina, you wait here.

00:05:39.339 --> 00:05:40.507
Princess!

00:05:40.674 --> 00:05:41.541
Mika: You alive?
Yeah! You?

00:05:41.608 --> 00:05:43.677
Mika: With Dad to seek
shelter underground.

00:05:44.444 --> 00:05:45.779
Of course.

00:05:45.845 --> 00:05:47.647
I worried for nothing.

00:05:47.714 --> 00:05:49.082
<i>Princess!</i>

00:05:59.092 --> 00:06:02.095
What does he mean by "princess?"

00:06:04.531 --> 00:06:06.132
Again?

00:06:06.499 --> 00:06:07.667
ID CONFIRMED:
HIROMI SHIRAHANE

00:06:07.734 --> 00:06:08.902
UNLOCK

00:06:18.144 --> 00:06:20.146
They said Lab 4.

00:06:20.413 --> 00:06:23.550
What are the security forces doing?

00:06:23.984 --> 00:06:25.585
What's this doing open?

00:06:25.652 --> 00:06:27.787
Who left it open?

00:06:28.888 --> 00:06:30.757
-The director.
-Again?

00:06:31.458 --> 00:06:35.028
Sometimes she can get ahead of herself.

00:06:42.769 --> 00:06:45.905
There's no point in quarantining him now.

00:06:45.972 --> 00:06:47.741
He's already out.

00:06:47.807 --> 00:06:49.542
It may be pointless

00:06:49.609 --> 00:06:52.879
but he is a very interesting specimen.

00:06:52.946 --> 00:06:56.049
If possible, I'd love to dissect him.

00:06:56.116 --> 00:06:57.717
Dr. Hausen?

00:06:57.784 --> 00:06:59.753
I was just joking.

00:07:01.655 --> 00:07:05.592
Kennosuke Oma, was it?

00:07:09.496 --> 00:07:10.864
Hello?

00:07:10.931 --> 00:07:13.166
I would like to talk to you.

00:07:18.104 --> 00:07:19.673
He understands Japanese, right?

00:07:20.974 --> 00:07:23.677
-Hiromi!
-Let go of the director!

00:07:23.743 --> 00:07:25.111
Let me out of here!

00:07:25.178 --> 00:07:26.780
Or else I'll break her neck!

00:07:26.947 --> 00:07:29.749
Oh, no! This is bad!
He's a bad guy!

00:07:38.124 --> 00:07:39.826
What amazing reflexes!

00:07:45.665 --> 00:07:47.467
-Princess!
-He found me!

00:07:47.534 --> 00:07:49.102
Forgive me!

00:07:54.708 --> 00:07:56.676
Why did you let him out?

00:07:56.843 --> 00:07:58.211
What choice did I have?

00:07:58.478 --> 00:08:00.981
More importantly, why was Yukina there?

00:08:02.849 --> 00:08:04.951
Yes? What, you want the director?!

00:08:05.752 --> 00:08:09.155
Hiromi, you left your phone
somewhere again, didn't you?

00:08:09.222 --> 00:08:10.890
This is Shirahane.

00:08:11.057 --> 00:08:12.559
What?! Open fire?!

00:08:12.726 --> 00:08:15.695
Absolutely not! What if you hit Yukina!

00:08:15.762 --> 00:08:17.530
Just absolutely not!

00:08:23.570 --> 00:08:25.005
Thank goodness you are safe.

00:08:35.982 --> 00:08:37.917
Who the hell are you?

00:08:37.984 --> 00:08:40.020
Am I not a "princess"?

00:08:40.086 --> 00:08:42.756
You are not the princess!
Who are you?!

00:08:42.922 --> 00:08:46.726
What do you mean? You're the one
who mistook me for someone else!

00:08:46.893 --> 00:08:48.161
Damn it!

00:08:48.228 --> 00:08:50.630
That means the princess is...

00:08:50.697 --> 00:08:53.566
And just who exactly are you?

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:56.669
I am just a soldier...

00:08:57.137 --> 00:08:58.938
who guards...

00:08:59.239 --> 00:09:00.273
the princess.

00:09:01.041 --> 00:09:02.042
How?!

00:09:02.175 --> 00:09:05.045
What on earth?

00:09:09.849 --> 00:09:10.950
Why now?

00:09:11.017 --> 00:09:14.621
It never responded to my calls before.

00:09:15.021 --> 00:09:16.723
Horse!

00:09:20.593 --> 00:09:22.295
No way.

00:09:22.962 --> 00:09:25.165
Don't fall off.

00:09:28.568 --> 00:09:31.738
Wait, what is going on?!

00:09:32.005 --> 00:09:32.872
Yukina!

00:09:34.074 --> 00:09:36.042
Is it below?

00:09:36.209 --> 00:09:38.912
I can feel it.

00:09:48.988 --> 00:09:50.757
This is crazy.

00:09:59.699 --> 00:10:00.934
Yukina?

00:10:09.609 --> 00:10:10.610
A giant?

00:10:10.677 --> 00:10:11.845
There you are.

00:10:12.812 --> 00:10:15.148
What is this?

00:10:15.215 --> 00:10:17.117
-It's a Mukuro.
-Mukuro?

00:10:18.251 --> 00:10:21.654
It's Kuromukuro, my Mukuro.

00:10:29.629 --> 00:10:30.330
Ow!

00:10:35.869 --> 00:10:38.037
What? What's this?

00:10:39.639 --> 00:10:40.373
I understand it.

00:10:46.646 --> 00:10:47.313
What?

00:10:48.014 --> 00:10:48.882
Ogres!

00:10:50.049 --> 00:10:51.284
Ogres?

00:11:20.380 --> 00:11:21.681
Prepare yourself!

00:11:45.872 --> 00:11:46.973
I'm so sorry!

00:12:02.855 --> 00:12:04.824
Where is this?

00:12:05.725 --> 00:12:08.127
I recognize these mountains...

00:12:08.194 --> 00:12:10.830
but what is this lake?

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:12.899
The work of the ogres?

00:12:12.966 --> 00:12:14.100
It's Kurobe Dam!

00:12:14.167 --> 00:12:16.135
The manifestation of human ingenuity!

00:12:16.202 --> 00:12:18.404
It's amazing, isn't it?

00:12:19.172 --> 00:12:21.240
What are you talking about?

00:12:22.909 --> 00:12:23.943
It's Yukina.

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:27.313
-What?
-I'm not "you."

00:12:29.048 --> 00:12:32.352
How long was I asleep?

00:12:32.418 --> 00:12:34.420
I don't know.

00:12:34.487 --> 00:12:38.825
I think the Cube
was discovered 60 years ago...

00:12:38.891 --> 00:12:41.094
It was probably way before that.

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:43.262
I am not interested in your nonsense!

00:12:43.329 --> 00:12:45.898
I'm being serious!

00:12:48.067 --> 00:12:52.071
Are you really from the past?

00:12:52.138 --> 00:12:55.341
I don't know what's past or present!

00:13:21.034 --> 00:13:25.872
The Black Shell Awakens

00:14:36.109 --> 00:14:37.377
Were you able to destroy it?

00:14:37.443 --> 00:14:41.914
Yes, a combined assault took out
the unit that landed in Nagano.

00:14:42.081 --> 00:14:43.449
This hasn't been confirmed

00:14:43.516 --> 00:14:46.519
but another unit at the Kurobe Labs
was destroyed as well.

00:14:46.586 --> 00:14:48.354
With just the garrisoned units?

00:14:48.421 --> 00:14:50.089
They used GAUS.

00:14:50.890 --> 00:14:51.958
Really?

00:14:52.024 --> 00:14:54.527
The remaining four units
have started to move.

00:14:54.594 --> 00:14:55.661
Where are they headed?

00:14:56.028 --> 00:15:00.032
For Object-1 which landed in Toyama.

00:15:00.400 --> 00:15:03.302
A new large-scale mobile weapon
has appeared.

00:15:03.469 --> 00:15:04.570
Where?

00:15:04.637 --> 00:15:06.506
From Kurobe Labs.

00:15:06.572 --> 00:15:10.276
If it continues on its course,
it will come in contact with Object-1.

00:15:10.343 --> 00:15:13.913
-I thought it was destroyed!
-Colonel!

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:17.016
It's from Kurobe Lab's Director Shirahane!

00:15:17.083 --> 00:15:19.018
From the lab?

00:15:19.085 --> 00:15:21.354
-Yes?
<i>-This is Director Shirahane.</i>

00:15:21.421 --> 00:15:25.124
<i>The large-scale geoframe that departed
<i>here is the Artifact Giant.</i></i>

00:15:25.191 --> 00:15:26.592
What? Giant?

00:15:26.959 --> 00:15:29.095
<i>Please do not attack it.</i>

00:15:29.162 --> 00:15:32.031
<i>It's one of humanity's most prized assets.</i>

00:15:33.566 --> 00:15:35.635
Artifact?

00:15:36.002 --> 00:15:40.306
<i>An emergency disaster warning
<i>has been issued.</i></i>

00:15:40.373 --> 00:15:44.610
<i>Tune into your television
<i>or radio station for further details.</i></i>

00:15:44.677 --> 00:15:47.547
Crazy stuff!

00:15:47.613 --> 00:15:50.183
What's going on?

00:15:50.616 --> 00:15:56.189
They said some unidentified giant robot
came up from the ocean!

00:15:59.392 --> 00:16:03.095
You won't be able to see it from there!

00:16:10.536 --> 00:16:12.538
What is that?!

00:16:15.608 --> 00:16:17.443
Cliff! Cliff! Canyon!

00:16:17.510 --> 00:16:20.413
River terrace! Braided river!

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:23.449
Hey! Don't destroy any houses!

00:16:23.516 --> 00:16:26.319
Oh, no, no, no! You can't kick the bridge!

00:16:26.452 --> 00:16:27.386
Stay quiet.

00:16:35.428 --> 00:16:37.129
Why do I understand this?

00:16:38.231 --> 00:16:39.432
Is this a radar?

00:16:40.166 --> 00:16:43.069
-You understand what it is?
-Yes.

00:16:43.135 --> 00:16:46.072
I don't know why,
but I just can.

00:16:46.138 --> 00:16:48.174
Maybe that is just the way it works.

00:16:49.375 --> 00:16:53.546
Please be careful.
We're almost to the city.

00:16:53.613 --> 00:16:55.181
City?

00:16:57.283 --> 00:16:58.150
What?

00:16:59.218 --> 00:17:02.154
What is that gathering of gravestones?

00:17:02.321 --> 00:17:05.358
Those aren't graves! They're buildings!

00:17:05.424 --> 00:17:06.459
Buildings?!

00:17:06.526 --> 00:17:09.095
Please don't break them, okay?

00:17:15.701 --> 00:17:18.704
What are you planning to do?

00:17:18.771 --> 00:17:23.109
No matter how much the world changes,
duty remains the same.

00:17:24.677 --> 00:17:26.512
To slay the ogres!

00:17:56.242 --> 00:17:57.677
What was that just now?

00:17:57.743 --> 00:17:59.712
-An ogre.
-Ogre?

00:18:09.255 --> 00:18:10.122
That's...

00:18:11.490 --> 00:18:13.125
the ogre?

00:18:14.193 --> 00:18:16.696
They're returning to eat the humans.

00:18:18.197 --> 00:18:20.533
They really did return.

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:22.568
Wait, I'm gonna get eaten?

00:18:22.635 --> 00:18:27.640
No way! First I get kidnapped,
now I might get eaten?! This is the worst!

00:18:27.707 --> 00:18:29.108
Stop your complaining!

00:18:29.709 --> 00:18:32.411
Human lives mean nothing to them.

00:18:32.478 --> 00:18:35.848
The world will perish
if we do not slay the ogres!

00:18:39.118 --> 00:18:40.653
There's a bunch of them now.

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:43.356
-How many?!
-Four!

00:18:57.436 --> 00:19:00.573
We're surrounded!
What are we going to do?

00:19:10.616 --> 00:19:11.784
It got through!

00:19:23.529 --> 00:19:25.531
-These damn grunts.
-To the left!

00:19:31.771 --> 00:19:32.638
Behind us!

00:19:53.959 --> 00:19:55.594
What?

00:20:01.467 --> 00:20:02.435
What?

00:20:13.679 --> 00:20:15.247
Stay still!

00:20:17.316 --> 00:20:21.954
Kennosuke,
why do you fight the ogres?

00:20:22.655 --> 00:20:25.491
Is it to protect someone?

00:20:26.759 --> 00:20:28.227
It's vengeance.

00:20:50.015 --> 00:20:51.417
Get back! Above us!

00:20:56.956 --> 00:20:58.390
Good eye!

00:21:10.569 --> 00:21:11.971
Time to finish this!

00:21:29.054 --> 00:21:30.523
I let it get away.

00:21:36.896 --> 00:21:40.866
Do I resemble your princess?

00:21:41.033 --> 00:21:42.735
Not at all.

00:21:42.802 --> 00:21:45.437
Then why did you mistake me for her?

00:21:45.504 --> 00:21:49.308
Can we find this princess somewhere?

00:21:49.608 --> 00:21:51.310
The princess...

00:21:52.678 --> 00:21:54.613
is dead.

00:23:41.854 --> 00:23:45.791
<i>We don't know anything
<i>about this black giant.</i></i>

00:23:45.858 --> 00:23:50.763
<i>Guess the samurai named
<i>it Kuromukuro.</i></i>
